        "created_at": "2013-02-23T15:07:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If Plague Rat has to search his deck for an infection, but the only infections are in play or in the trash, do you shuffle the trash into the deck, or do you just not get an infection coming into play?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>i have been playing that nothing happens, but now I am not sure. Thanks.</p>",
