        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-02-23T15:38:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We've been doing the same - it just says to search the deck for an Infection card, doesn't it? So if all five Infection cards are all either in play or in the trash, there aren't any in the deck, so I just don't bother searching it as it doesn't specify to search anywhere else.</p>",
