        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-02-23T20:19:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hmm, good point - I hadn't thought about the factor of deck control \"needing\" to be messed up by the shuffle. I suppose that should be the case with any deck, for example if Ra has put a certain card (via, for example, Tempest's Reclaim from the Deep) on the top of his deck and then plays Summon Staff but all four staves are already accounted for (ie in trash/hand/play), you'd still need to shuffle the deck and lost whatever you'd put on top, right?</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:27:35.264Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
