        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hmm, good point - I hadn&#39;t thought about the factor of deck control &quot;needing&quot; to be messed up by the shuffle. I suppose that should be the case with any deck, for example if Ra has put a certain card (via, for example, Tempest&#39;s Reclaim from the Deep) on the top of his deck and then plays Summon Staff but all four staves are already accounted for (ie in trash/hand/play), you&#39;d still need to shuffle the deck and lost whatever you&#39;d put on top, right?</p>",
